y it's a lot like fishing but  you're the bait  exactly i don't know but it is good to  know they don't want to hurt you that  they're more afraid of you than you are  of them but you look at their teeth and  all that logic to me goes out the window  but i know people that love sharks that  say we're the problem and not them so i  think the more educated we are the  better off we'll all be so thank you  thank you carter thank you for that
 

